# Content and UI

Copy, URLs, entity details, nav, FAQs, and form options live in `src/content/`. Components render that data. Do not hardcode ACN, support email, login URL, or legal body copy in JSX.

Legal documents are data (`src/content/legal/`) rendered by `LegalPage`. Do not add `LegalH2` / `LegalP` public helpers. Change title size, grid, or meta rail in `LegalPage` only.

Horizontal padding is `siteInsetClass` from `src/components/ui/SiteInset.tsx` (`px-5 md:px-8 lg:px-10`). Vertical section padding is `siteSectionClass` (`py-24 md:py-32`). Stacked chapter gaps are `siteStackClass` (`gap-24 md:gap-32`). Use `SiteInset` / `SiteMeasure` instead of repeating those classes. Full-bleed blocks (Hero, film stills, quote marquee) stay unpadded.

Nav/menu/CTA labels stay uppercase (`Request a Demo`, `Log in`, `Menu`). Do not mention third-party reference sites in code, comments, or commit messages.

Delete unused components and copy when a page no longer needs them. Do not keep clinic/gym/multi-product scaffolding.
